 #5327 merged — append-only GitHub webhook hot list + consumer checkpoints on main (confirmed fresh by the task 12027 triage of #2072, 2026-11-08, and by triage task 12108 of #3321, 2026-11-08).\n\n## Scope\n\n- Consume GitHub events from the landed slice-2 hot-list stream into the #1739 common event contract, following PR #5141's writer pattern: stable source IDs (`activity:github:<sourceId>` shape), source links.\n- Replay/retry idempotent via persisted checkpoints; tests cover duplicate deliveries and restart (the same guarantees PR #5141 established for Kaneo/watchdog).\n- GitHub-source outages, lag and unrecoverable gaps exposed with source/time range, never presented as complete history; documented coverage distinguishes supported, unsupported and historical ranges for the GitHub source.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Re-doing PR #5141 (Kaneo/watchdog) or PR #5327 (the webhook receiver/hot list). No competing receiver.\n- #2072 slices 3–7 (separate issues, e.g. #7078).\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- [ ] GitHub events from the slice-2 stream appear in the common stream with stable IDs and source links.\n- [ ] Duplicate delivery + restart tests pass for the GitHub source; aggregator suite green.\n- [ ] Gap/lag state for the GitHub source is visible in the same surface PR #5141 used; coverage for the GitHub source is documented.\n- [ ] On landing, #3321's acceptance boxes are re-checked and #3321 closes or names precisely what remains.\n\n<!-- filed 2026-11-08 by repo queue worker lane code-s (triage task 12108 conversion, following the #2072 slice-filing pattern of tasks 7285/12027) -->\n","closed_by":{"login":"dezren39","id":11225574,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMjI1NTc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11225574?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39","html_url":"https://github.com/dezren39","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dezren39/following{/other_user}"